      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ffded046",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "racist meme audience",
      "description": "The target audience consists of individuals who are familiar with or propagate racist stereotypes, particularly those who engage with or create content that dehumanizes Black people by equating them with primates. This audience may include users of internet platforms who consume and share hateful memes, often targeting prominent Black public figures like Michelle Obama. The meme’s intent to demean Michelle Obama through racist imagery and text is designed to resonate with those who hold or reinforce anti-Black racist beliefs, using the juxtaposition of Clint Eastwood (a white male icon) and Michelle Obama (a Black female public figure) to reinforce racial hierarchies. The audience is likely to be drawn to the meme’s provocative and offensive nature, which appeals to those who enjoy or are entertained by racially charged, degrading content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
